{"id":"6f068c38418e21f2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-canonical-model.md","title":"GL Canonical Model","display":"df-gl-canonical-model — GL Canonical Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","aliases":["89-df-gl-canonical-model"],"display":"df-gl-canonical-model — GL Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","[[89-thm-gl-consistency]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-canonical-model — GL Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"12a315bba5062a88\" href=\"?note=12a315bba5062a88\" title=\"89-thm-gl-consistency\">89-thm-gl-consistency</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_L\">\\(\\mathcal M_L\\)</span> 是一致正规逻辑的典范模型构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 的正规性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 分别由所列两条上游证明。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是下文引入的模型别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 85–87、90–91；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>参数实例化所需的一致性和正规性已有独立证据，故世界集合非空。世界是局部极大一致集，不对任意世界假设施用必然化。这个别名只保留一般典范模型的固定赋值；它的框架不是自动得到的 GL 框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"12a315bba5062a88","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-consistency]]","embed":false}],"math":